SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LI - I just want to ride (and eat) (22 R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n## Details\n\nRide Leader
 : Bruce Black\n\nAn enjoyable ride north of Lititz with very little climbi
 ng. We will stop at Zig's for food/beverage. The pace will be 14 - 16 mph 
 average. Multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5). Please park in the upper p
 arking lot of the library.\n\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists ar
 e not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfo
 rtable paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone b
 iking alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ri
 de with GPS links:\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/52679937](https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/52679937)\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan t
 o bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire leve
 rs\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a cl
 ub member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub
 .net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub
 .net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement 
 to abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.c
 om/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbi
 keclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32
 3984)\nand Rules of the Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conten
 t.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club
