 e advertised average speed. This is intended to be a no-drop group ride. T
 here is often\, but not always\, a sweep.\n\nThere is usually - but not al
 ways - a portable toilet at the start location parking lot. (The restroom 
 building at the parking lot is never open.)\n\nPost-ride coffee/refreshmen
 ts - [Javateas](https://javateas.com/) 1 Dutchland Ave Ephrata - along rou
 te 272.\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bot
